--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
3. ONE THING NO LICENSE CAN DO
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Every outcome figure on this site ships with a caveat, because most of them need
one: a state ranking moves on population growth and local property values as
well as on state law, and one of the figures is a single-state time series rather
than a randomised finding. CC0 means you may reuse a number without the
sentence that qualifies it.

Please don't. The caveats are the careful part, and a figure without its caveat
is worse than no figure.
